    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "07b565315071754a21e0": "Since my husband left for the front, Helene here has been my strength. Her kind heart and sharp sword have helped me through a lot of tough times. I don't know what I would've done without her.",
        "53a34e176bc27c18a014": "Gosh, I'm sorry. I don't have anything new to teach you. How about you go talk to Simon Tanner in the Old Town section of Stormwind? He's a human with big muscles and dreamy red hair.",
        "60188faa62d54db9486f": "Train me.",
        "9635f2d41b797ee0bf16": "How's it going? I love the smell of leather; don't you?"
      },
      "name": "Adele Fielder",
      "subName": "Journeyman Leatherworker",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
